    "detailed_description": "<h1>WISHLIST THE FULL GAME</h1><p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1>Dwarven Defense Prologue is a minimalist tower defense game. Plan, build and upgrade your defenses at daytime, so that you survive the hordes of undead attacking you at night. Aided by powerfull abilities and an autonomous hero unit, your strategic skills will be put to the test.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Prologue</h2>The prologue features one level which is equiped with an endless mode for highscore hunting.<br>This feedback on this small scope game will help shape the paid version.<br>The paid version will feature 3+ Levels, more Towers, Abilites, Heroes and a progression system.<br><br>The undead are here!<br>But fear not. With the help of your best dwarven engeneers and old magic runes you can hold you ground. Build your defenses and survive the apocalypse.<br><br>Build mighty towers<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912470/extras/0289eefeadf3d605947cb84f70c7a69c.poster.avif?t=1725461178\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912470/extras/0289eefeadf3d605947cb84f70c7a69c.webm?t=1725461178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912470/extras/0289eefeadf3d605947cb84f70c7a69c.mp4?t=1725461178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br>Upgrade your defenses<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912470/extras/2bd29df754ded3a809252fed461f8d32.poster.avif?t=1725461178\" width=600 height=178 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2912470/extras/2bd29df754ded3a809252fed461f8d32.webm?t=1725461178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https: